<div id="A4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#A4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix D Table Generation Settings ‣ Visual-TableQA: Open-Domain Benchmark for Reasoning over Table Images" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, we present the average validity rates of the generated QA pairs for each model involved in the QA generation phase.</p>
