<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>ROSCOE Metrics Scores</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The ROSCOE evaluation scores are reported in Table <a href="#A7.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix G ROSCOE Metrics Scores ‣ Visual-TableQA: Open-Domain Benchmark for Reasoning over Table Images" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.T7" class="ltx_table">
