<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The hyperparameters used for LoRA are reported in Table <a href="#A8.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix H Model Finetuning Hyperparameters ‣ Visual-TableQA: Open-Domain Benchmark for Reasoning over Table Images" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>.</p>
