<td id="A8.T8.10.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.T8.10.4.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">8</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A8.T8.10.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.4.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:45.5pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.4.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.T8.10.4.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">all-linear</span></span>
<span id="A8.T8.10.4.5.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.T8.10.4.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">(llm frozen)</span><sup id="A8.T8.10.4.5.1.2.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="A8.T8.10.4.5.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">∗∗</span></sup></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T8.10.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A8.T8.10.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A8.T8.10.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.T8.10.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">InternVL2-8B</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A8.T8.10.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td>
<td id="A8.T8.10.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.T8.10.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">16</span><sup id="A8.T8.10.5.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="A8.T8.10.5.3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">∗</span></sup></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A8.T8.10.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.T8.10.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">32</span><sup id="A8.T8.10.5.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="A8.T8.10.5.4.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">∗</span></sup></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A8.T8.10.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T8.10.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A8.T8.10.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;" colspan="5">
<span id="A8.T8.10.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.T8.10.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">* The InternVL training source code sets the LoRA alpha as twice the LoRA rank, as shown in their official implementation <a href="https://github.com/OpenGVLab/InternVL/blob/main/internvl_chat/internvl/train/internvl_chat_finetune.py" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">here</a>. We followed this convention for full reproducibility and assumed that other baselines applied the same rule.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T8.10.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A8.T8.10.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:1.2pt;padding-bottom:1.2pt;" colspan="5">
<span id="A8.T8.10.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A8.T8.10.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.T8.10.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">** The InternVL and MiniCPM (<a href="https://github.com/OpenSQZ/MiniCPM-V-CookBook/blob/main/finetune/finetune.py" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">here</a>) training source codes automatically freeze the LLM when LoRA is used. We followed this convention for full reproducibility and assumed that other baselines applied the same rule.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
